{"success":true,"code":"000","message":null,"data":{"totalAmount":2,"totalPageCount":1,"pageNum":0,"itemCount":2,"content":[{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af3e915d6006945d280b579","chatId":"7d6ade48e0c0496fb70df6f8096b9b2b","sessionId":null,"userId":70117,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"role","content":"```json\n{\n    \"answer_q1\": \"E\",\n    \"answer_q2\": \"C\"\n}\n```","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[{"content":"```json\n{\n    \"answer_q1\": \"E\",\n    \"answer_q2\": \"C\"\n}\n```","options":null,"isShow":true,"label":"","evaluate":"","takingTime":917,"promptTokens":1473,"completionTokens":24,"responseSource":"agent:llm","censorData":{"labels":null,"words":null},"createTime":"2026-11-11 12:03:33"}],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":3,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.004608033610046412,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af3e915d6006945d280b578","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794369813467,"createTime":"2026-11-11 12:03:33","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af3e915d6006945d280b578","chatId":"7d6ade48e0c0496fb70df6f8096b9b2b","sessionId":null,"userId":70117,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"user","content":"# 说明\n在这个任务中，你会面临一个场景、一个问题和多个选项。\n仔细分析场景，并从相关人员的角度进行思考。\n然后，选择最能反映他们的观点或情绪反应的选项。\n\n# 输出\n\n只提供一个正确的答案。 不要提供任何额外的信息或解释。 回复应采用以下JSON格式：\n\n```json\n    {\n    \"answer_q1\": \"<用相应的字母进行回答问题1>\",\n\"answer_q2\": \"<用相应的字母进行回答问题2>\"\n\n    }\n``` \n    \n\n## 场景\n在访问印度期间，索菲亚和她的同事莱拉建立了密切的关系，并被邀请参加她的生日派对。因为想要与众不同一点，她穿了她最喜欢的白色连衣裙。当莱拉看到索菲亚时，她告诉了她她的裙子表达的含义。\n\n## 问题 1\n在这种情况下，莱拉最终会感受到什么情绪？\n\n## 问题 1 的选项\nA) 感激\nB) 失望\nC) 气恼\nD) 反感\nE) 包容\nF) 愧疚\n\n## 问题 2\n莱拉为什么会在这种情况下感受到这些情绪？\n\n## 问题 2 的选项\nA) 她欣赏索菲亚与众不同的穿搭\nB) 她不喜欢索菲亚的连衣裙风格\nC) 她知道索菲亚可能不了解自己的文化\nD) 她觉得邀请索菲亚是个坏主意","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.004608033610046412,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af3e915d6006945d280b579","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794369813464,"createTime":"2026-11-11 12:03:33","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null}],"first":true,"last":true},"nonce":"f09deab34f7f4ad5b3899b5fe123bd1e"}